-- synopsis
My first forray into microtonal music

(Go back to the album Downloads for the Strudel code).
-- synopsis

--more
Trying out some microtonal stuff, and really like how this one turned out. 
I chose a random microtonal scale and ended up using Erza Sims’s 18 tone mode (based on 72 EDO, idk what the ratios are though).
Surprisingly he was very influential in Boston’s microtonal scene (which I’m not a part of, lol, but is cool to know).
Somehow while writing this I forgot it had 18 notes and thought it was 12, so i stuck to the lower half of the scale.
--more